@startuml park-and-resume
!include ../_includes/theme.puml

title Park and resume through the board goal

actor "Person or main loop" as P $PERSON
participant "task-board session park" as K $SERVICE
participant "Session host" as H $SERVICE
participant "Orchestrator session" as S $AGENT
database "Board" as B $COMMITTED

== Park ==
P -> K: park SES [--reason]
K -> H: park directive
H -> S: doorbell (interrupt): write a park note
S -> B: park note on the goal element:\nruns in flight, Change Requests awaiting\nreview or integration, pending decisions, next steps
K -> B: new goal revision: same objective,\nhandoff_ref = the note
K -> H: resumable stop (the goal is not cleared)
H -> S: stop

== Resume ==
P -> H: start, wake or keeper up\n(task-board claude, the main loop)
H -> B: read the parent/primary head
H -> S: /goal ... [rev N+1, handoff "<note>"] <condition>
S -> B: read the park note first
S -> S: continue the work

caption Sources: spec §8; pkg/board/board_goal_v2.go (BoardGoalRevision); emergency stop: spec §9
@enduml
